    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'Sullivan Hurley are delighted to welcome to the market for sale by private treaty this large detached home of approx. 3000sq.ft. set on a circa 1.26 acre site. The property is constructed of block build with roof, windows and doors all in place and part stone and render facade. Internally the property requires full finishing with stud timber framework walls in place throughout for layout entailing 2 reception rooms, kitchen/dining, conservatory, utility, w.c. and an ensuite bedroom on the ground floor. There are 4 bedrooms on the first floor all complete with walk in wardrobes and access to en-suites. The layout could also easily be reconfigured to suit your own desired layout with the property requiring first and second fixing along with all final finishes both internally and externally. \n\nElectricity was previously connected with a septic tank on site ready to be connected and a water meter connection at the front boundary available. Initial planning approval granted in 2004 for construction of detached dwelling with garage with current building complete in 2006 we understand. Floorplans as attached are for guide purposes only of a potential layout but this can be completely reconfigured to suit ones own preference internally. \n\nThere is also potential to achieve grants such as SEAI and the vacant/derelict homes grants to help with completion of the property subject to meeting qualifying conditions. \n\nThis property is located just off the N68 close to the village of Lissycasey and Caherea National School with ease of access to Ennis town centre and for those commuting to Shannon, Limerick and Galway via the M18 motorway in just about 10minutes drive. This is an excellent opportunity to complete this large dwelling to your own style and finish with a blank canvas available situated on a fantastic large site."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nSitting Room - 4.8m x 4.7m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.9m x 4.7m\n\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.1m x 4.7m\n\n\nConservatory - 6.5m x 3.8m\n\n\nUtility Room - 3.4m x 2.7m\n\n\nGuest W.C. - \n\n\nBedroom - 3.9m x 3.4m\n\n\nEnsuite - 2.5m x 1.3m\n\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom - 4.7m x 4.5m\n\n\nEnsuite - 3.4m x 2.5m\n\n\nWalk in Wardrobe 1 - \n\n\nWalk in Wardrobe 2 - \n\n\nBedroom - 4.7m x 3.4m\n\n\nEnsuite - 2.4m x 1.4m\n\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - \n\n\nBedroom - 4.7m x 3.8m\n\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - \n\n\nEnsuite - \n\n\nBedroom - 3.9m x 3.4m\n\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Approx. Floor Area; 278.7 (3,000sq.ft.)</li><li> Site Size circa 1.26acres (0.51H)</li><li> Year of Build 2006</li><li> Potential to Attain Vacant Homes and SEAI Grants</li><li> Blank Canvas to Complete to Your Own Style</li><li> Excellent Location 10mins to Ennis</li><li> Easy Access to Lissycasey Village and Caherea School</li><li> Septic Tank on Site (Final Connection Required)</li><li> Electric Available (Reconnetion Required)</li><li> Local Lissycasey Group Water Scheme Connection Available</ul>"
